# --- Regenerable dashboard intermediate ---
# `python -m dashboard.app` writes this alongside dashboard/index.html. It is
# ~700 KB of full replay traces and is a build input to the HTML, not a result:
# the numbers worth keeping are in results/*.json and in the rendered export.
results/dashboard_payload.json

